WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Show a ready glove. Use a soft ball and a comfortable distance.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Watch it all the way. Receive a gentle, easy-to-reach throw in your glove.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Secure the catch. Use your free hand to secure the ball, then reset.

